# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.airkernels).
#
# Every compute kernel of the corpus, dispatched on the Adreno. This is the question softpipe
# cannot answer and has been deferred twice: of the 47, six dispatch on software and 38 stop in
# nir_to_tgsi, which has no scratch memory and lacks compute intrinsics that ir3 has
# (tools/air/kernelcheck.py). So those 38 are not a statement about the frontend or the GPU --
# they are a statement about a software rasteriser, and only the phone can replace it.
#
# What this run can establish is capability, not correctness. There is no executed reference for
# these kernels anywhere: softpipe will not run them, so a number from the Adreno has nothing on
# this machine to be compared against, and air_run's own buffer and image readback is the only
# output. A kernel that dispatches and prints plausible numbers has been shown to RUN; whether it
# computed what Metal says is a separate question with no second source today. Read the lines as
# "dispatched" or "refused", not as agreement.
#
# The first line is the shader M1 is stated against, with --disasm: it proves the GPU is there and
# that ir3 compiled what ran, which the screen name alone does not.
/redwood/bin/air_run --disasm /System/Library/Extensions/AppleMetalGLRenderer.bundle/default.metallib clearFragment01
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_Uint
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_Uint
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_UintPacked
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_UintPacked
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_Unorm
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_Unorm
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitKernel_Unorm
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainLumaKernel_Uint
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainChromaKernel_Uint
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainLumaKernel_Unorm
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainChromaKernel_Unorm
/redwood/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_Clear
